.TH QUIPU-INGEST 1 "" quipu "Quipu Manual"
.SH NAME
quipu\-ingest \- Bulk\-load an N\-Triples, Turtle or N\-Quads file into one graph with declared count and digest
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBquipu ingest\fR [\fB\-\-db\fR] [\fB\-\-graph\fR] [\fB\-\-timestamp\fR] [\fB\-\-declare\-count\fR] [\fB\-\-declare\-sha256\fR] [\fB\-\-format\fR] [\fB\-\-chunk\fR] [\fB\-\-base\-iri\fR] [\fB\-\-actor\fR] [\fB\-\-source\fR] [\fB\-\-blank\-node\-scope\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIfile\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Bulk\-load an N\-Triples, Turtle or N\-Quads file into one graph with declared count and digest
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-db\fR \fI<PATH>\fR
Store file (default: .bobbin/quipu/quipu.db; configuration may override it)
.TP
\fB\-\-graph\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR

.TP
\fB\-\-timestamp\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR

.TP
\fB\-\-declare\-count\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR

.TP
\fB\-\-declare\-sha256\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR

.TP
\fB\-\-format\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR

.TP
\fB\-\-chunk\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR

.TP
\fB\-\-base\-iri\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR

.TP
\fB\-\-actor\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR

.TP
\fB\-\-source\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR

.TP
\fB\-\-blank\-node\-scope\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR

.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIfile\fR>

